Fix build with LLVM 23

Comgr 10.2 takes ISA properties from TargetParser queries that were added in
LLVM 24. With LLVM 23, use the per-ISA table that Comgr 10.1 shipped, and the
SGPR helpers, which are also LLVM 24 only.

